<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF's Kuroda says currency policy unchanged.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF's Kuroda says currency policy unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japanese Ministry of Finance's (MOF) policy on currencies remains unchanged, Haruhiko Kuroda, director-general of the international finance bureau, told reporters on Wednesday evening.</p>
<p>He added that he had no specific comment on the currency market.  </p>
<p>&quot;As I said earlier (on Wednesday), MOF policy is unchanged,&quot; he told reporters before delivering a speech to the regular summer meeting of the Forex Club.</p>
</text>
